NOAH-MP GDAS Forcing Testcase

This is a test case that uses:
  (a) SGP region with 1 nest (1km)
      Lambert projection
  (b) Simulation time period from 12Z 11 Jul 2015 to 12Z 12 Jul 2015
  (c) MODIS geographical data
  (d) uses the lapse-rate based elevation correction using GTOPO30
      elevation data
  (e) 4day LIS spinup Noah-MP LSM with GDAS forcing and budget-bilinear Interpolation
  (f) Goddard MP (3ice) and Goddard 2017 radiation
  (g) 1hr WRF simulation with WRF-LIS coupling (NoahMP LSM) 
